  "details": "It would be cool, and granted I'm sure there is a million requests for this in the pool of things. But ide like to explain it with my words and hope it catches.\n\nwe spent a few minutes changing and managing our settings between worlds. beyond simple shield settings. Like setting download caps and rates.\n\nIt would be really cool to have savable profiles where A profile can be made saving the state of ALL settings and then can be activated by a single click, As a bonus feature you can also make them xml/json profiles so you can share them. (How would be up to you guys)\n\nThe shield was intended to solve this. But as we grew in our options the shield levels now is just a small part of the pie.",
